Inflicts [29, 39, 46, 53, 58 (TL1-5; MP 100)] darkness damage each turn for [5, 6, 7, 8, 9 (TL1-5)] turns, and has a [31%, 37%, 41%, 44%, 47% (TL1-5; MP 100)] chance to randomly cause blindness, stun, or confusion (lasting 3 turns).

If the target is sleeping, the chance of avoiding a negative effect will be halved and fear immunity will be ignored.

The damage will scale with your Mindpower.
